{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/874daa8feddcf3ed382d1a2a16ed7fa0.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the shoes of a curious child and explore haunted mansions in cooperative VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything feels bigger, closer, and more unsettling when you\u2019re small, and you\u2019re never truly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/d090bed416232aadf0b74e60f282c3e6.poster.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/d090bed416232aadf0b74e60f282c3e6.webm?t=1772202841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/d090bed416232aadf0b74e60f282c3e6.mp4?t=1772202841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/b3c2a13e28d508ee86123c4c37f801e5.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every house has its own supernatural threat. Some stalk you when you\u2019re alone. Some hide in reflections. Others turn the house itself against you. Learn how they behave, or become part of the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/e0695d7eff337935f50cd78d0689bee3.poster.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/e0695d7eff337935f50cd78d0689bee3.webm?t=1772202841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/e0695d7eff337935f50cd78d0689bee3.mp4?t=1772202841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/fa2b37bd8893c13a57f2be786f91cf1c.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore deeper to collect valuable treasures, solve strange puzzles, and uncover hidden rooms. Push your luck for greater rewards, but fail, and everything you carry is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/c5d83cada675c22fa03a916e41031d6e.poster.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1170 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/c5d83cada675c22fa03a916e41031d6e.webm?t=1772202841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914490/extras/83a75cfafb1c0f50ba6e1d5cbfc09f47.avif?t=1772202841\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Tr